{"id":"2410290184","kind":"answer","title":"你支持英语退出中考吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2022-03-27","updated":"2022-03-27","votes":16,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":835,"keywords":["学习动机","学校教育","强制学习","自由学习","记忆稳定性"],"summary":"定义 考试 就是利用大考和小测对知识进行评估。一些设计良好的考试，可以提供对良好的知识和推理技能的评估。 考试的问题 考试的问题是，它通常是强制性的，而且是预先宣布的。强制性的高风险考试涉及压力。预先宣布的考试促进了 死记硬背 [1] 。 死记硬背 促进了 无语义学习 [2] ，导致专注于低质量的短期记忆。这种短视关注导致了…","question_detail_html":"<p>中考取消英语，你支持吗？</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/510559953/answer/2410290184","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"定义"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"考试的问题"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"哪如何考察英语？"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"sec-1\"><b>定义</b></h2><p data-pid=\"E-0dEzQb\"><b>考试</b>就是利用大考和小测对知识进行评估。一些设计良好的考试，可以提供对良好的知识和推理技能的评估。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\"><b>考试的问题</b></h2><p data-pid=\"a6RgFHBT\">考试的问题是，它通常是强制性的，而且是预先宣布的。强制性的高风险考试涉及压力。预先宣布的考试促进了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Kevin_Kruse:_School_serves_mindless_cramming\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">死记硬背</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Cramming\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">死记硬背</a>促进了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Asemantic_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">无语义学习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，导致专注于低质量的短期记忆。这种短视关注导致了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Interference\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">干扰</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>、糟糕的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Memory_stability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆稳定性</a>、糟糕的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coherence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">连贯性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>，增加了对不相关部分知识的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">遗忘</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>，等等。考试还增加了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stress\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">压力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>，破坏了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">睡眠</a>，增加了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Why_kids_hate_school\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对学校的厌恶</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"jWltzcDq\">多项选择题考试可以提供一个很好的知识评估工具，但也会鼓励获胜的策略，导致有害的学习形式，即基于记忆，而不是理解。这放大了考试所造成的损害。</p><p data-pid=\"v2fBN-Ie\">短期限的考试会让孩子在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Regress_zone\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">退步区</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>学习，因为这违反了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Fundamental_law_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的基本法则</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup>。它偏向于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Cramming\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">死记硬背</a>，淡化长期记忆的重要性。见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/50_bad_habits_learned_at_school\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">在学校学到的50个坏习惯</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"KKP4QeCv\">考试只能作为一种研究工具。如果绝对必要，考试也可以被公司和机构用作处理大量无法管理的应用程序的过滤器。如果学校把考试作为录取的过滤器，他们可能会失去优秀的学生。</p><p data-pid=\"Uh_YdBKj\">考试是造成<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Problem_of_schooling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学校教育危害</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-10\"><a href=\"#ref-10\">[10]</a></sup>的主要原因之一</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a894930ae6bfc083c4b2ab42af76fc2a_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"826\" data-image-width=\"1200\" data-tm-id=\"417595864\" href=\"#/post/417595864\">叶峻峣：考试</a><h2 id=\"sec-3\">哪如何考察英语？</h2><p data-pid=\"mAaahOJH\">类似英语四六级一样，每年都有两次考试机会，学生可以自主选择什么时候参加考试。</p><p data-pid=\"4teVTpCt\">更多相关内容可见：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-4ae5342f29a2b1008425b8d6c39f99ac_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1112\" data-image-width=\"1304\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/20275692/answer/2386164401\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">为什么许多人学了十几年英语仍旧学不好英语？</a><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 死记硬背 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"360416156\" href=\"#/post/360416156\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 无语义学习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"295053968\" href=\"#/post/295053968\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 干扰 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"269974053\" href=\"#/post/269974053\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 一致性与连贯性(Consistency vs Coherence) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"264327134\" href=\"#/post/264327134\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 遗忘机制 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"265081034\" href=\"#/post/265081034\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 18 压力适应力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"73207325\" href=\"#/post/73207325\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 20 为什么孩子们讨厌学校？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"70779863\" href=\"#/post/70779863\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 11 最佳推动区 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"67694020\" href=\"#/post/67694020\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 学习的基本规律 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"273225977\" href=\"#/post/273225977\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-10\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-10\">↩</a> 我永远不会送我的孩子去学校 <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"273225977","title":"学习的基本规律","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":137,"minutes":4,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"73207325","title":"18 抗压韧性","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":86,"minutes":19,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"70779863","title":"20 孩子们为什么讨厌学校？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":9,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"67694020","title":"11 最佳推动区","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":18,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"264327134","title":"一致性与连贯性","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":60,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"265081034","title":"遗忘机制","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":59,"minutes":8,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"306014650","title":"老汤比喻","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":36,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"269974053","title":"干扰","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"281085595","title":"不要在没有理解之前就去记忆","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":158,"minutes":9,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"417595864","title":"考试","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":45,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"266922623","title":"语义学习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":92,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"